   "stem": {
      "text": "Find the area of the region bounded by the polar curve \\( r = 3 \\sin{\\left(\\theta \\right)} + 13 \\) for \\( 0 \\le \\theta \\le \\pi \\) and the rays \\( \\theta = 0 \\) and \\( \\theta = \\pi \\).",
